# NIBS: Cursor entry point

All project memory lives in agents/ and is shared with every other agent on this repo.

Before any task:
1. Read agents/AGENTS.md: how to work here, which file wins, how to record what you learn.
2. Read agents/CONSTITUTION.md: the permanent design, product and engineering rules.
3. Follow the reading order in agents/AGENTS.md for agents/PATTERNS.md, agents/PRODUCT.md and agents/WORKING_LOG.md.

Don't add rules to this file. Record discoveries in agents/WORKING_LOG.md.
